e, he ate this every Saturday of his life. Supper number three. Salt pork and potatoes in cream gravy. This one was in every camp, everywhere, because salt pork kept all winter without ice, and potatoes came out of the root cellar by the bushel, slices of salt pork fried crisp, boiled potatoes, and a white gravy made in the pork fat. The trick is to soak the salt pork 20 minutes in cold water first to pull out some of the salt, then fry it slow until it's crisp. Pour off all but a quarter cup of fat, cook the flour in it a full minute until it smells nutty, then whisk in the milk a little at a time. Fold in the potatoes, crisp pork on top", "words": [{"w": " Navy", "s": 0.08, "e": 0.46}, {"w": " beans,", "s": 0.46, "e": 1.4}, {"w": " salt", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.58}, {"w": " pork,", "s": 1.58, "e": 2.36}, {"w": " molasses,", "s": 2.36, "e": 3.02}, {"w": " and", "s": 3.02, "e": 3.12}, {"w": " the", "s": 3.12, "e": 3.26}, {"w": " rest.", "s": 3.26, "e": 4.08}, {"w": " About $4.50", "s": 4.06, "e": 5.66}, {"w": " for", "s": 5.66, "e": 6.24}, {"w": " eight", "s": 6.24, "e": 6.48}, {"w": " people.", "s": 6.48, "e": 7.4}, {"w": " About", "s": 7.56, "e": 7.84}, {"w": " 55", "s": 7.84, "e": 8.52}, {"w": " cents", "s": 8.52, "e": 8.92}, {"w": " a", "s": 8.92, "e": 9.1}, {"w": " plate.", "s": 9.1, "e": 9.92}, {"w": " Saturday", "s": 10.08, "e": 10.44}, {"w": " night,", "s": 10.44, "e": 10.88}, {"w": " baked", "s": 10.88, "e": 11.22}, {"w": " beans", "s": 11.22, "e": 11.56}, {"w": " with", "s": 11.56, "e": 11.8}, {"w": " brown", "s": 11.8, "e": 12.14}, {"w": " bread.", "s": 12.14, "e": 13.04}, {"w": " If", "s": 12.94, "e": 13.1}, {"w": " your", "s": 13.1, "e": 13.26}, {"w": " grandpa", "s": 13.26, "e": 13.74}, {"w": " came", "s": 13.74, "e": 14.12}, {"w": " from", "s": 14.12, "e": 14.38}, {"w": " Maine,", "s": 14.38, "e": 15.12}, {"w": " he", "s": 15.12, "e": 15.2}, {"w": " ate", "s": 15.2, "e": 15.46}, {"w": " this", "s": 15.46, "e": 15.76}, {"w": " every", "s": 15.76, "e": 16.04}